@host = http://localhost:5281
# Docker compose exposes the API on http://localhost:8080 instead.

### Create an employee -> 201 + Location header
POST {{host}}/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "hireDate": "2023-04-17",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNo": "+1 (555) 010-1234",
  "profilePicture": "https://example.com/jane.jpg",
  "status": "active",
  "address": "1 Main Street",
  "state": "Massachusetts",
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "Boston",
  "pincode": "02101"
}

### Invalid input (future date, bad phone, unknown status, javascript: URL) -> 400 with per-field errors
POST {{host}}/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "  ",
  "hireDate": "2999-01-01",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "phoneNo": "12345",
  "profilePicture": "javascript:alert(1)",
  "status": "unknown",
  "address": "1 Main Street",
  "state": "Massachusetts",
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "Boston",
  "pincode": "02101"
}

### Same email again (case does not matter) -> 409
POST {{host}}/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Someone Else",
  "hireDate": "2023-04-17",
  "email": "JANE.DOE@example.com",
  "phoneNo": "+15550101234",
  "status": "inactive",
  "address": "2 Side Street",
  "state": "Massachusetts",
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "Boston",
  "pincode": "02101"
}

### Get by id (replace the id with the one from the Location header) -> 200, unknown id -> 404
GET {{host}}/employee/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### List with paging and search -> 200
GET {{host}}/employees?page=1&pageSize=10&search=jane

### Invalid paging -> 400
GET {{host}}/employees?page=0&pageSize=1000

### Update (full replacement) -> 200 / 400 / 404 / 409
PUT {{host}}/employee/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe-Smith",
  "hireDate": "2023-04-17",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNo": "+15550101234",
  "status": "inactive",
  "address": "1 Main Street",
  "state": "Massachusetts",
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "Boston",
  "pincode": "02101"
}

### Delete -> 204, unknown id -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/employee/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
